@startuml
[*] --> Select Amount
State "Select Amount" as select_amount {
  Entry: Present user with list of withdrawal options
}
select_amount -->[*] Custom Value Entry : User chooses to enter a custom value
State "Custom Value Entry" as custom_value_entry {
  Entry: Prompt user for custom value
}
custom_value_entry --> Transaction Verification : User submits custom value
State "Transaction Verification" as transaction_verification {
  Entry: Verify transaction (e.g., check account balance)
  Transition to Re-entry if verification fails
}
transaction_verification -->[*] Select Amount : Transaction is successful
Re-entry --> Select Amount : User re-enters an amount

@enduml
